      <p class="text-gray-300">Hawk Host is a long-running Canadian budget VPS provider, in business since 2004, that pairs US-friendly pricing with genuinely global datacenter coverage. 7 locations including Singapore and Hong Kong make it one of the rare sub-$15/mo options for Asia-Pacific buyers.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Starting at $5.00/mo</p>
    </div>

