        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ NVMe on all plans — including the $5 entry tier</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 7 global datacenters (US x3, Canada, UK, Singapore, Hong Kong)</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Full root access + KVM virtualization</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 60-day money-back guarantee — well above the industry 30-day norm</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Free website migrations on all plans</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 24/7 ticket-based support with published SLA</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">❌ No hourly billing — monthly or annual only</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">❌ No GPU instances — CPU-only workloads</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">❌ Self-managed only — no managed-services tier</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">❌ Smaller community than RackNerd / Vultr; fewer third-party tutorials</li>
          <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">❌ Storage allocations are modest at the entry tier (40 GB at $5)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

